# 22. DSP-Referenzpipeline für WBFM

```text
RTL-SDR IQ
→ U8 to complex float
→ DC blocker
→ optional IQ correction
→ shift
→ WBFM channel FIR
→ decimate
→ optional limiter
→ FM discriminator
→ deemphasis
→ mono oder MPX-Auswertung
→ audio LP
→ resample
→ output
```

