# 23. DSP-Referenzpipeline für Airband-AM

## Envelope-Pipeline
```text
RTL-SDR IQ
→ complex float
→ DC removal
→ shift
→ complex channel FIR
→ decimate
→ envelope demod
→ DC removal
→ audio LP
→ optional AGC
→ output
```

## Sync-AM-Pipeline
```text
RTL-SDR IQ
→ complex float
→ shift
→ schmaler komplexer FIR
→ decimate
→ carrier estimation
→ synchronous demod
→ DC removal
→ audio band limiting
→ slow AGC
→ output
```

