# 24. DSP-Referenzpipeline für NFM/PMR

```text
RTL-SDR IQ
→ Normierung
→ DC removal
→ shift
→ complex FIR
→ decimate
→ optional limiter
→ FM discriminator
→ audio LP
→ squelch
→ output
```

